Using model: Claude Opus 4.6

╭────────────────────────────── Claude Opus 4.6 ───────────────────────────────╮
│                                                                              │
│  Based on the search results, I don't have direct access to the project's    │
│  design.md file. Let me reason based on common hotel pricing engine          │
│  patterns for Vietnamese hotel systems like SkyHotel, where G1, G2, G3       │
│  typically represent guest count tiers for monthly rates.                    │
│                                                                              │
│  Based on my understanding of hotel pricing engines (particularly            │
│  Vietnamese systems like SkyHotel), here's the implementation for Task 6.7   │
│  - Unit test: case G1, G2, G3 (monthly):                                     │
